# Per-zone frames (module/zones_sim.c): each look's frame drawn on both halves, every zone's lamp
# its zone's colour and the 15 dead lamps a half black (left out of the draw lines); the check
# line counts the looks that match the app. What the right link carries is host-frames' business.
/^frames: right link/d
/^frames:/p
/^hostlink: rx D7 8C/p
s/.*hid_listener_keycode/kp/p
